{"content":[{"c":["AMALEKITES, H",{"c":["ill"],"sourceClass":"lc","t":"span"}," C",{"c":["ountry"],"sourceClass":"lc","t":"span"}," (M",{"c":["ount*) of the"],"sourceClass":"lc","t":"span"}],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["An area near Pirathon in Ephraim, probably about six miles (9.6 kilometers) west of Shechem (",{"href":"?bref=Judg.12.15","r":"Judg.12.15","rawR":"Judg.12.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.12.15","value":"Judg.12.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 12:15"},"). It is mentioned in the Hebrew Bible but not in the Greek manuscripts of the OT. Some scholars find the reference confusing; however, it is possible that an argument based on ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.5.14","r":"Judg.5.14","rawR":"Judg.5.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.5.14","value":"Judg.5.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Judges 5:14"}," and ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.12.15","r":"Judg.12.15","rawR":"Judg.12.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.12.15","value":"Judg.12.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"12:15"}," can be made that there was a small Amalekite district in Ephraim."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"AmalekitesHillCountryMountofthe","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jgs 12:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.12.15","rawQueryValue":"Judg.12.15","sourceRefExact":"Judg.12.15"},{"anchorText":"Judges 5:14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.5.14","rawQueryValue":"Judg.5.14","sourceRefExact":"Judg.5.14"},{"anchorText":"12:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.12.15","rawQueryValue":"Judg.12.15","sourceRefExact":"Judg.12.15"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"bfcf134a34f5f07b78e2d59dda633967d9769a7a4114b169f83a7de1552a9f20","sourceItemName":"AmalekitesHillCountryMountofthe","sourceItemOrder":277,"sourceMember":"Articles/A.xml","supp